# LangChain Custom Chat Model Integration

## Overview

This project creates custom LangChain chat model integrations that wrap proprietary or private LLM APIs while maintaining full compatibility with LangChain and LangGraph ecosystems.

## Core Architecture

✓ Inherit from `BaseChatModel` for full LangChain compatibility
✓ Use Pydantic for configuration and validation
✓ Implement async-first with sync fallbacks
✓ Support callbacks for observability and tracing

### Required Imports

```python
from langchain_core.language_models import BaseChatModel
from langchain_core.messages import AIMessage, BaseMessage, HumanMessage, SystemMessage, ToolMessage
from langchain_core.outputs import ChatGeneration, ChatResult
from langchain_core.callbacks import CallbackManagerForLLMRun, AsyncCallbackManagerForLLMRun
```

## Implementation Checklist

✓ Implement `_generate()` method (required)
✓ Define `_llm_type` property (required)
✓ Implement `_agenerate()` for native async
✓ Implement `_stream()` for streaming support
✓ Implement `bind_tools()` for tool calling

